<br><br>
Surface Nonmetal Mine<br>
(Cement)<br>
Fatal Machinery Accident<br>
January 25, 2005<br>
<br>

Artesia Quarry and Mill<br>
Holcim (US), Incorporated<br>
Artesia, Lowndes County, Mississippi<br>
Mine I.D. No. 22-00313
<br><br>

Investigators

<br><br>
Terry G. Lingenfelter<br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
